description: Never commit or push the local .codegen directory to GitHub
alwaysApply: true
---

# `.codegen` is local-only

- `.codegen/` (the `zero_codegen` tool and merged JSON) must **never** be committed or pushed to GitHub.
- It is listed in `.gitignore` as a safeguard. Do not force-add it.
- Clone/setup copies the tool onto disk so `pnpm codegen:*` can run; GitHub must not contain it.
